{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Confederate Express</strong> is a <i>hardcore</i>\u00a0mouse-only clicker puzzle that leaves no room for mercy. Set in a grim dystopian future, you\u2019re  trying to deliver a mysterious package. Sounds simple, right? Wrong. In this game, making it past level 3 feels like a victory. The difficulty curve is less of a curve and more of a sheer cliff, with each of the 50 levels designed to break your spirit and test your very will to continue.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mouse-Only Mayhem</strong>: Forget multiple inputs\u2014this game is all about precision, as every action is driven by nothing more than your mouse. One wrong click? You're back to square one. Get used to the grind\u2014it\u2019s the only way forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experimental, Brutal Gameplay</strong>: Confederate Express is a niche experiment in extreme difficulty. It\u2019s <i>not</i> designed to be accessible or easy. It\u2019s designed to test whether you\u2019re tough enough to survive. <i>Spoiler</i>: Most aren\u2019t. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/771370/extras/118b41e4aaeba882dde7034be0627249.poster.avif?t=1759957285\" width=410 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/771370/extras/118b41e4aaeba882dde7034be0627249.webm?t=1759957285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/771370/extras/118b41e4aaeba882dde7034be0627249.mp4?t=1759957285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LORE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a decaying, dystopian world, you play as a merciless exterminator on a mission to deliver a mysterious package. The path is riddled with impossible scenarios, where each level throws you into a blood-soaked battle against vicious enemies who use deadly tactics. Every encounter is a test of skill and survival, and failure is inevitable\u2014but each death only brings you closer to uncovering the dark secrets of the world you\u2019re trying to navigate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/771370/extras/21e9bbdfb832f3acb5c4382401f06b27.poster.avif?t=1759957285\" width=426 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/771370/extras/21e9bbdfb832f3acb5c4382401f06b27.webm?t=1759957285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/771370/extras/21e9bbdfb832f3acb5c4382401f06b27.mp4?t=1759957285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TECHNOLOGY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confederate Express boasts an unmistakable visual style - &quot;<i>aliasing</i>&quot; - powered by a proprietary  rendering framework - <strong>False2D\u2122 API</strong>. This technology allows for an unparalleled visual fidelity, transforming a collection of over 50,000 hand drawn animation frames into a spectacular flurry of visual feast.<br> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SUMMARY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Confederate Express</strong> is a hardcore, niche experience built for those who crave an insane challenge. It\u2019s visceral, punishing, and relentless experience, pushing your patience, reflexes, and even your sanity to the limit.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Baby steps","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/771370/3e62549108bf4932f6508281aee16ac5067057c0.jpg"},{"name":"Dozen","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/im